cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this research atlas with the exact Git commit used.
  Source-level fidelity and independent review are tracked separately
  from machine checking. No archived release DOI has been assigned.
type: software
title: Formal Atlas of Semantics
authors:
  - family-names: Chatzikyriakidis
    given-names: Stergios
repository-code: https://github.com/StergiosCha/formal_atlas_of_semantics
url: https://orange-beach-0c447e210.5.azurestaticapps.net
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A 230-source survey connected to explicitly scoped Coq implementations,
  source-to-code audits, checked comparisons, countermodels and a
  provenance registry. Intrinsic source formality and project evidence
  are separate axes. The atlas investigates which representations,
  assumptions, clarifications and additional commitments mechanization
  requires; it does not claim whole-source verification of the corpus.
keywords:
  - formal semantics
  - proof assistants
  - Coq
  - Rocq
  - research provenance
